{{Quote|A source of anti-entropic radiation ideal for empowering synthetic lifeforms, most notably Archons and Warframes.|In-game description}}
'''Archon Shards''' are permanent upgrade items taken from [[Archon]]s and used by the [[Helminth]] to further enhance a [[Warframes|Warframe]].

==Lore ==
Archon Shards are used by [[Narmer]]'s Archons, giving them immense energy and life. The Archons can also use the energy from the shards to reanimate slain [[Sentient]]s, and allows the Archons to reanimate themselves if they fall in battle. This can be countered by removing the shard from the body of the Archons, as without the shard, the Archon merely slumps over and perishes.

