}}

====Coalescent Fusion====
'''Coalescent Fusion''' allows the player to fuse two of the three primary Shard colors to form a new type of Archon Shard, featuring unique upgrades.

When selecting the Coalescent Fusion option in the Archon Shard menu, the player will be prompted to choose from any of the unslotted Shards they own. Normal Archon Shards can only be fused with other normal Shards; likewise, only Tauforged Shards can be fused with other Tauforged Shards to create a Tauforged variant. Once a selection has been made, the Helminth requires a sacrifice of 50 {{Resource|Stela}} to commence fusion.

*Combining {{Resource|Crimson Archon Shard|Crimson}} and {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard|Azure}} creates a {{Resource|Violet Archon Shard}}.
**Combining {{Resource|Tauforged Crimson Archon Shard|Tauforged Crimson}} and {{Resource|Tauforged Azure Archon Shard|Tauforged Azure}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Violet Archon Shard}}.
*Combining {{Resource|Crimson Archon Shard|Crimson}} and {{Resource|Amber Archon Shard|Amber}} creates a {{Resource|Topaz Archon Shard}}.
**Combining {{Resource|Tauforged Crimson Archon Shard|Tauforged Crimson}} and {{Resource|Tauforged Amber Archon Shard|Tauforged Amber}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Topaz Archon Shard}}.
*Combining {{Resource|Amber Archon Shard|Amber}} and {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard|Azure}} creates an {{Resource|Emerald Archon Shard}}.
**Combining {{Resource|Tauforged Amber Archon Shard|Tauforged Amber}} and {{Resource|Tauforged Azure Archon Shard|Tauforged Azure}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Emerald Archon Shard}}.

'''The fusion is permanent and cannot be reversed.''' The player is prompted to type '''CONFIRM''' before fusing.

====Ascent Fusion====
'''Ascent Fusion''' allows fusing three Shards of the same color to convert them into a Tauforged.

When selecting the Ascent Fusion option in the Archon Shard menu, the player will be prompted to choose from any of the unslotted Shards they own. Once a selection has been made, the Helminth requires a sacrifice of 100 {{Resource|Stela}} to commence fusion.

*Combining three {{Resource|Crimson Archon Shard|Crimsons}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Crimson Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Amber Archon Shard|Ambers}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Amber Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Azure Archon Shard|Azures}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Azure Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Emerald Archon Shard|Emeralds}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Emerald Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Topaz Archon Shard|Topaz}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Topaz Archon Shard}}.
*Combining three {{Resource|Violet Archon Shard|Violets}} creates a {{Resource|Tauforged Violet Archon Shard}}.

'''The fusion is permanent and cannot be reversed.''' The player is prompted to type '''CONFIRM''' before fusing.

